<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>I enjoyed learning to be a lady.</i>

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:28.760
<i>I was glad to have some alone time with Lady Kihel.</i>

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.940
<i>At Her Majesty Dianna's friendship party,</i>

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:36.450
<i>I had to pretend to be Laura and dance with Lieutenant Harry.</i>

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:40.490
<i>I also tried to persuade Her Majesty Dianna to stop this war.</i>

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.860
<i>It was difficult.</i>

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:50.500
<b>Laura's Cow</b>

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.060
Ow!

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.430
Are you alright?

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.730
How's Vicinity?

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:18.850
Is Mother finally willing to talk to me now?

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.660
Mother will probably be happier if things stay the way they are.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.660
Her own daughter is helping to negotiate with the ones who killed her father.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.120
It's best she doesn't know.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.960
That's not the right attitude to have.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.750
If you're consumed by hatred, we'll never find a way to solve the problems!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.920
Leave this war to us, the Militia soldiers!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:41.590
With enough power, we can drive those Moon people off Earth!

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:44.840
<i>- Come in.</i>
- Yes, sir.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:48.930
The volunteers from the Floria and Luzianna colonies are now in formation.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:52.850
They followed Colonel Michael's instructions and stationed themselves along the Cellular River, sir.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:56.180
Excellent.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.240
As long as we have those machines from the Dark History, we'll have all our cards.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.450
Laura, get ready to start up the White Doll.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.030
- Where am I going?
- Outside of Nocis City.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:09.100
But we're in a cease fire now, and everyone's looking for the group who tried to assassinate Dianna.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.460
In that case...

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:15.540
We'll patrol the borders of the Moonrace's area in defense to keep their activists under control.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.250
Will you do it?

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.840
<i>I'm not saying this just because I look like Dianna,</i>

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.720
but judging by her appearance, I can tell she's not a dangerous person.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.220
What about her aides?

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.640
I don't think they have something up their sleeve.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:34.560
But not all of the people of the moon are like them.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:35.520
Yeah.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.860
There's also the part of Dianna Counter that attacked the Mountain Cycle.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.360
The warmakers.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.700
Some of the Militia soldiers believe that all we need to do is win the war against them.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.740
There are many different kinds of people in this world.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.250
What do you think of Laura?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.530
He's an honest kid.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:59.480
In order to hide a personal secret, he's honest about everything else.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.840
You think so?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.960
That's what makes him so reliable.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:13.940
Why can't I?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.650
I haven't learned enough from this electric notebook to teach you how to operate it.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.990
Plus, I'm still against you fighting in this war, Milady.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.940
You don't understand how I feel, Loran!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:29.450
You don't understand how I feel about my family, or about Daddy's death!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.370
l'm trying to understand you!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.040
You just don't get it at all!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.240
You're so much luckier, Loran...

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.920
Don't let them install that fence!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.220
Get outta here!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.130
Fix that truck for us!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.350
<i>The Moonrace's pesky mechanical dolls are everywhere!</i>

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.350
Loran, let's go help those guys!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.440
If I do that, it could start a war!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.940
We've gotta stop this bastard!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.440
<i>- They're coming!
- I said stop, dang it!</i>

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:09.030
Here we go again...

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.950
Don't mess with us installing our fence!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.160
What're you gonna do, kill us?!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.910
Dammit, if that's what you want, just try it!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.620
If you don't get the hell outta our way, I'll really--

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.710
What are you talking about?! We've owned this land for generations!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.460
<i>You're not gonna steal our harvest!</i>

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.620
That's...!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.590
You think you can bury us!?

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.640
You ain't gettin' through!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.350
Please, stop this! What the Terrans are saying is true!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.850
Stay out of this, civilian!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:38.350
Our people returned here because we heard our races would be negotiating a solution.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.360
We didn't intend to take your crops!

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:43.230
<i>- Shut up!
- Please wait!</i>

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.450
<i>We're in a ceasefire.</i>

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.240
Please, don't hurt our civilians!

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.230
You're just bullying them!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.080
It's that mechanical doll, the White Doll!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.290
The Earth's mobile suit!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.750
Lets show them what we can do, Loran!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.580
There are still people down there. Please move!

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:05.540
To move the suit, I need full control of these arm control balls.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:09.300
- Hold your fire against that mobile suit--
- No shit!

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.260
If you use force, the Militia will naturally fight back against you.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.770
Please wait for Queen Dianna's conference to finish!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:18.790
A Mobil Rib and the mustached mobile suit?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.190
Were they arguing with each other?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.350
Is Loran the one driving it?

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.780
Why did they come all the way out here...?

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.070
People are suffering...

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:33.950
Miss, if you're a reporter, please write about how the Moonrace came and took away our grain!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.250
Report it on the radio news too!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.620
At this rate, we won't make it through winter!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.370
Of course, I can write about that, but...

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.630
Wait, is that really Fran?

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.960
You know her too?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.630
I know all about you guys, Loran!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.760
Be sure to publish that story!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.760
Well, I am a newspaper reporter.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.050
So the bread's only for the army... can't be helped then.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.560
We'd like to sell some of your bread too.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.350
Thanks for your interest, but I'm doing this alone.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.150
You could hire more people, buy more ovens, and increase your production rate.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.980
Well, yeah, I could... but...

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.440
I guess so, yeah!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.450
You civilians should just follow the Army's instructions!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.990
You're the ones who brought us down from the Moon!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.330
Kuwen!

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.450
The food rations you gave us are nearly gone!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.660
Stop it, Kuwen!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.660
Stealing from the Terran people...

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.330
- I can't do something like that!
- Better shut your trap, buddy!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.250
So you use brute force whenever things don't go your way?!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.340
The military isn't your damned babysitter!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.370
Is there a problem?

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:32.050
Please, reconsider the terms when negotiating the sunbelt zone!

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.510
Please let us relocate there!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:36.640
The Citizen Welfare Department isn't allowed to take part in the Return Policies.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.220
Stop putting up a fuss and return to your home.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.230
l have a baby at home!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.850
My wife became ill because of the stress of moving to Earth.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.650
If you don't knock it off, I'll imprison you.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:49.440
Kuwen, that's enough! If they take you, what are Lesha and Renae gonna have left to live off of?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.530
The Terrans might even attack them!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.450
- That's why l...
- Don't worry.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.950
Whatever they do, we'll be risking our lives to keep your hides safe.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.230
Now get lost!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.250
Lesha... Renae...

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:16.260
l don't think I want to go back to the Moonrace.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:19.350
Were you thinking about returning to Dianna Counter and living in the Sunbelt Zone?

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.430
l don't want to move to the South.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:25.230
Hey, do you know if there are any pigs or cows around here?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.730
Giving up baking for butchery?

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.940
Since I'm only a baker, I can't provide anyone with milk easily.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:35.910
Those struggling farmers who've lost their land need meat, eggs, chickens, and many other things.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:39.450
It's their problem! They're the ones who decided to come here!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.660
The Militia's got plenty of supplies...

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.820
We've even got reinforcements arriving from all over!

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:49.630
Who is she, and why is she here? Is that Miss Heim?

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.960
She came here to learn how to control the Mustache.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.920
And just what if she finds out...?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.630
Finds out what?

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:59.300
More disputes may break out if the Militia learns about events here.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.720
Right, Loran?

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.680
Y-Yeah, we'd better keep it a secret for now.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.440
They'll learn about it eventually.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.650
E-Exactly!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.640
I smell a rat!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.440
You guys are keeping a secret from me, aren't you?

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.660
- No way!
- You're lying!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.740
You guys are spies!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:26.080
You've been hired by the Moonrace to report on the Earth and Militia's manpower, and then they pay you, right?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.630
No! It's not like that at all! Right, Fran?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.890
I'm a neutral reporter for the <i>Nocis Chronicle</i>.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.130
Could a guy with a stupid face like this be a spy?

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.840
More importantly, we're all just kids.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.630
In Vicinity, you become an adult when you turn fifteen.

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:47.230
A spy wouldn't let himself pilot the Militia's mechanical doll.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.940
Loran, you're fighting for the Earth, right?

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.690
Uh, yeah. I mean, I guess so.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.150
So am I!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.530
I just want to learn to shoot proper photography.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:00.950
But my woman's intuition tells me you guys are keeping something from me.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:04.530
When did you guys first become friends, anyway?

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:07.830
- We're from the same hometown!
- We're from the same hometown!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.540
We're lifelong friends!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:14.960
Very well. Even though I don't carry the Holy Marks, I'll believe you. I <i>am</i> an adult, after all.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.340
Thanks, Sochie.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.870
Let's move on.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:22.750
Why is Loran here with his White Doll in the first place?

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.520
Guin Rhineford sent the White Mustache here.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.150
Her Majesty Dianna realizes why he did this.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.530
He's nothing more than a barbarian.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.950
They're just covering up for the mastermind behind the assassination attempt.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.160
Perhaps we should take action in the name of civil safety?

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.030
Allow me to use the WaD team.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.330
The Militia soldiers might attack our civilians.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:49.310
We need to keep that White Mustache of theirs in line.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:51.120
We can't use the WaDoms.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.080
It'll draw them out to attack us.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.920
Understood.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.340
That's a Militia truck, isn't it?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.930
Loran!

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.260
Nice work!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.850
Where did you get this?

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.420
<i>Fran!</i>

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:11.500
I hate this sort of thing! The Moonrace and crying babies...

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.940
The angrier you get, the more you'll make her cry.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.980
Is that baby there giving you trouble, My Lady?

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:20.210
I didn't volunteer for this! I hate the Moonrace!

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:22.160
l don't care if she starves or whatever!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.410
I'm very sorry, little miss.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.650
Loran's the idiot who made me do this.

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.340
Keith, you and the others stay here.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.260
Sure.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.430
We'll try to see what else we can find.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.760
Y-Yeah.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.060
You can hold on tighter, y'know.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:54.350
N-No, my hands are sweaty.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.360
You'll be fine if you take your coat off.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.360
But it does take some guts to leave your concession zone.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.740
No, you guys are the brave ones.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.440
It sure would be nice to find some milk...

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:19.550
Hey, stop!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.750
Hey, what's really happening here!?

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:25.960
What? Over here?

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.020
You, Keith, and Loran...

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.060
You guys all moved here two years ago.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.650
Did you do something bad?

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.520
You should ask Loran that.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:41.360
He doesn't tell me anything.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.820
I'm sure he says more to you guys, his close friends.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:47.160
Yeah. Keith and Loran both think the same way.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.440
Besides, they both have someone they like too.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:54.240
Uh... It's just a secret between Keith and Loran.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.540
D-Don't tell anyone!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:00.250
These days, Keith's been getting pretty close to the daughter of the boss at his bakery.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.590
They both like each other.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.380
- You're not worried?
- Why should I be?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.930
Want me to tell you Loran's favorite phrase?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.550
Tell me!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.970
He says, "Milady Heim is so wonderful!"

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.480
Which one of us does he mean?

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.640
Miss Sochie!

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.730
This corn is great!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.860
Is it?

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.240
Where did the people who lived here go?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:30.440
Dianna Counter's air raids scared off all the Terrans who were living here.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.960
I'm starting to understand how they feel.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:45.760
When I was on the moon, the thought of finally returning to Earth made me dance with joy.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:49.550
And yet there were already people living here on Earth.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:54.930
In order for us to live here, we must face the facts and realize we're driving them from their homes.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.560
We also have to survive.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.650
But we can't just blindly obey the Army's every word!

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:07.450
The season called winter will come, and there's a limited supply of crops these lands can produce.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.240
It'd be strange not to be concerned.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:13.740
But that's why we should still make use of even this land that have been abandoned.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.310
Yes, that's true. I'm very grateful for that.

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:21.450
I don't know if you'll be able to use the money Dianna Counter printed, but...

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.960
I hope this compensates for what I took.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:30.510
Mr. Loran!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:33.840
A cow! It's a cow!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.760
It's a girl! Look at those udders!

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.640
C'mon... C'mere, girl...!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.360
You ever caught a cow before?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.950
Uh, no...

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.160
Then how do you plan to bring it back?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.660
How? Well... We could drag her back...

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.830
Drag her back? She's pretty strong!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.040
We can't even move her!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.120
With lovely udders like that, we have to find a way!

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.830
I've never dealt with a cow before...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.330
Here, girl...

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.920
<i>Why don't we use the White Doll?</i>

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.300
Hold on a sec!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.140
I promise not to cook you in a stew!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.560
I won't turn you into ham, steak, or sausages either!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.640
Or liverwurst...

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.850
I'll give up dessert too!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.850
Why isn't Loran here at a time like this?!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.640
Loran!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.560
Good work.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.460
Are things alright?

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.460
<i>I'm afraid I'll crush him. I can't do precision work well.</i>

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.130
Loran! If you kill that thing, you'll suffer for it!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:53.840
This thing doesn't exactly have a "pig catching" setting on it. It's tough!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.260
Keith?

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:02.730
What are you doing?! Get that hay into the truck!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.760
I thought I was gonna die!

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.360
I have no idea where they're going...

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.120
We'll know what's up when we get there.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.040
Huh? It's Dianna Counter!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.320
A WaD! Let's hurry up and get Mr. Kuwen out of here!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.250
Are you telling us to run away?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.960
<i>- Milady!</i>
- Coward!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.460
We can't fight them on this truck! Hurry!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.330
How rude!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.760
The Militia truck is trying to run away!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.920
So this is part of their plan after all!

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:42.680
Damn!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:59.370
Stop it! There are civilians on that truck!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:03.000
The Earth's mobile suit is damn agile! It's a special one!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.540
Mr. Kuwen!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.210
Dianna Counter mobile suits, incoming!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.240
Are they here for me?!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.250
Those udders!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:12.840
- Get in the car!
- R-Right!

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.010
Hurry!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.680
The piglet's father?!

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:21.260
There's one left chasing us!

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:22.630
Leave it to me!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:28.560
Has Dianna Counter been reduced to a pathetic military that bullies civilians?!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.650
That one's gonna get us!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.140
Loran, stop him!

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:43.160
You've been acting rather suspicious!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.870
Are you planning to kidnap Queen Dianna!?

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:46.960
<i>That's not it!</i>

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.960
<i>We're not doing this for the Militia's sake!</i>

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.890
In that case, surrender! We'll hear your reasons after that.

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:54.880
We're finished.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:18:01.130
<i>If I surrender, she'll find out that Sochie is a Militia soldier, and they'll discover this mobile suit's technology!</i>

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:05.430
<i>Ensign Poe, listen to me!</i>

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.850
Ensign Poe! We are in a ceasefire!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.650
Release them at once!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.650
Mind your own business, Lieutenant Harry!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.650
Until we find out who the real assassins were,

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.490
Her Majesty Dianna has ordered that there will be no fighting!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.820
But...!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.530
<i>Your WaD team must withdraw at once!</i>

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.650
R-Roger!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.620
Is that Lieutenant Harry of the Royal Guard?

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.960
It's the Lieutenant!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.630
He's full of himself!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.660
Don't be angry, Ensign Poe.

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:36.800
Are you with us, then?

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.590
Yes. I... My name is Kuwen Morad.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:45.310
I-In order to let my wife and daughter survive, please allow me to raise livestock in the southern woods!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.340
No, stay there!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:53.940
I will speak to the Department of Emigration oh behalf of all the Returned citizens, I assure you.

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.320
You can be sure Her Majesty Dianna will hear of this.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.650
T-Thank you so much...!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.330
Laura! You're helping out our civilians?

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.790
We're all human beings.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.160
That's kind of you.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.530
Again, thank you very much...!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.980
Now then, don't be scared...!

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.940
That's the way!

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.690
Lesha, I found us a nice, healthy cow!

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.150
Thank you, dear! And everyone else, too!

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:48.600
It's truly a magnificent find!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.030
- Mr. Kuwen, I'm gonna let you down!
- Go ahead!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.040
Look, it's a big cow!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.460
Our good friends brought it back for us.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:01.460
The big cow's gonna give you lots of milk!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.260
Lesha...

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:09.840
<i>Thief!</i>

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.940
Whice village did you swipe that from?!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.230
We don't raise those just so you can eat 'em!

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:15.360
<i>Give it back!</i>

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.020
We didn't steal it!

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.900
We just took in a stray!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.950
Those guys are the ones who drove them away in the first place!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.860
You moon people should go back there!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.740
Wait! I left a form of payment behind to compensate for them!

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:30.540
We just can't survive without these animals!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.460
And have you seen what happened to the northern village?!

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.120
It's abandoned!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.420
You people are the ones ruining our lives here!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:39.130
<i>If you hadn't come, we'd still be living the way we were!</i>

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.550
<i>That's right! Go back to the Moon!</i>

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:43.050
<i>We don't care if you moon people starve to death!</i>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.780
Wait!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:47.550
Every one of us is a human, and they've got children too!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:51.930
Why can't we offer to help them!? It's unbelievably cruel of you to simply wish them to die!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.230
Hey, aren't you a Militia soldier?

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.900
Whose side are you on, anyway?!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.360
<i>The people of the moon were the ones who started this invasion!</i>

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:03.570
<i>E mi et le, escontina</i>

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.440
<i>If they never attacked us, I wouldn't be forcing them out!</i>

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.860
<i>That's right!</i>

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:03.860
Something's up with Loran...

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:10.870
<i>O plenitas, o colindia</i>

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.320
Wait, is he...? He can't be...!

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:09.150
Loran! Don't do it, Loran!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:18.080
<i>Mi mortis sicle ha juus costro</i>

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:15.120
I... I have to... I can't hide it anymore...

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.450
Loran!

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:19.590
This won't end well...

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:25.670
<i>Mawé poco entalius</i>

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:24.800
Everyone, I... I... I'm a Moonrace.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:28.250
I'M FROM THE MOONRACE!

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:36.550
<i>Taan ma taan, la-la-loo, la-la-loo</i>

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.550
- He's Moonrace?!
- Are you serious?!

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.940
That boy...

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.400
He's a good kid.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:41.610
Loran is... a Moonrace?

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:50.660
<i>Plaute tai mi fai o gunema...</i>

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:43.940
He's just too honest.

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:47.950
I was sent here two years ago.

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.660
And so, I stand against those from the Moonrace.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:53.240
And I'm fighting for the people of Earth!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:54.580
<i>(mundiana, mundiana)</i>

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.330
I'll fight against anyone who doesn't cherish human life!

00:21:54.580 --> 00:22:07.590
<i>Taan les tai, la la la, la la loo</i>

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:57.920
No matter who they are, I will fight them!

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:03.460
<i>The picture I took made the front page of the </i>Nocis Chronicle<i>.</i>

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:09.430
<i>The article was about the White Doll's pilot who wished to bridge the gap between Earth's people and Moonrace:</i>

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:19.100
<i>Morie taan mi fai es volta</i>

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:12.050
<i>The Militia's Laura Rola.</i>

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:17.850
No way...!

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:19.430
Loran, you liar!

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:47.020
<i>As part of the Earth Return Plan, Corin is released from stasis, and attacks the Mountain Cycle without permission.</i>

00:23:47.750 --> 00:23:51.280
<i>Miashei and the other Kapool Fighters find themselves in a predicament.</i>

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:56.110
<i>And then when Sochie's piloting the White Doll, Corin suddenly shouts aloud...</i>

00:23:57.550 --> 00:24:00.290
<i>Next time, on </i>Turn-A Gundam,

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:03.210
<i>Corin Cried 'Gundam'</i>

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:05.910
<i>"The wind carries his voice."</i>

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Corin Cried 'Gundam'</b>
